# Tenant Onboarding

## Flow

1. Owner submits `/registro` form → `POST /api/onboarding`
2. Creates `Tenant` with `status: pending`
3. Creates `TenantOnboarding` record
4. Creates first `User` (dueno) with `isActive: false`
5. Super-admin approves via `PATCH /api/platform/tenants/[id]` action `approve`

## Slug Rules

- Pattern: `^[a-z0-9-]{3,30}$`
- Reserved: `app`, `www`, `api`, `admin`, `platform`, `registro`

## Status Transitions

- `pending` → `active` (approve)
- `pending` → `rejected` (reject with note)
- `active` → `suspended`
- `suspended` → `active` (reactivate)

## On Approval

- Set tenant `status: active`
- Activate dueno user (`isActive: true`)
- Record `reviewedAt` and `reviewedById` in onboarding
